#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon_ifc.rst:147
msgid "3. Cross validation (CV)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon_ifc.rst:149
msgid ""
"In this step, we explain how to run the different sets of CV calculations"
" separately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon_ifc.rst:151
msgid ""
"The calculation of different sets can be executed in parallel because "
"they are independent of each other. So, if you have a cluster computer "
"with multiple cores, you can run the calculations of each CV set in "
"separate jobs. The preparation of the input files is slightly "
"complicated, but it will be time-saving when the computational cost of "
"the CV calculation is significant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon_ifc.rst:157
msgid ""
