"with 4 sets. Thus, we want to use the first 25 data (``NSTART_CV = 1``, "
"``NEND_CV = 25``) in the validation process in the calculation of the "
"first CV set (set1). Note that these 25 sets have to be excluded in the "
"training process (``SKIP = 1-25``)"
